   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The place suffix",
   "texto": [
    "**-da/-de/-ta/-te** means «en». It is added at the end of the name: **evde** (at home), **okulda** (at school).",
    "The vowel fits the last vowel; after deaf consonants like **k, p, t, ç, f, h, s, ş**, d changes to t: **parkta** (in the park).",
    "**Nerede?** = where? **Nerede çalışıyorsun?** = where do you work?"
   ]
